Title: "Piecewise"
Id: "2a27570f-bf32-4e95-b1ff-e1fd950fb5cc"

Text: "`piecewise:` records a piecewise clause with required `if:` and `then:` sections and an optional `else:` section.

```mlg-fragment
piecewise:
if: x = 0
then: y = 0
else: y = 1
```

The `piecewise:` section itself may contain optional open text used as a label or description. The checker validates each clause in its appropriate context."
Id: "424c501c-f2b6-45b2-a491-f598bd0dc21e"
